"""Form-family and occurrence definitions (C12 Workstream G).

Rules followed when writing this file:
* Every title, anchor and field label is copied from the printed text of the
  cited copy (the build verifies each one against that copy's text layer and
  fails if an exact-mode source does not contain it).
* Anything not printed is not recorded; unknown values are stated as unknown.
* "prescribing_provision" and "requirement_quote" quote the instrument text
  with its page; where the only source is an unverified manual that is said.
* Classification values are CANDIDATES on the blueprint axes; nothing here is
  a legal determination. Every row is DISCOVERED_FROM_SOURCE_NOT_LEGALLY_APPROVED.

Occurrence keys:  src, pages=(first,last) for pdf sources, or anchor+from_line
for line sources; `anchor` is the printed heading used to locate/verify it;
`role` is PRIMARY (field transcription source) or ALTERNATE.
"""

AR4 = ("AR 4(1) [AR54-GAZ p.2; AR54-IC p.1-2]: 'The forms set forth in the appendices to these rules, "
       "with such variations as the circumstances of each case may require, may be used for the respective "
       "purposes therein mentioned, and if used, shall be sufficient, but a deviation from such forms shall not, "
       "by reason only of such deviation, render invalid any charge, warrant, order, proceedings or any other "
       "document'; AR 4(2) omission not invalidating; AR 4(3) notes/instructions 'shall be duly complied with' "
       "but omission does not by itself invalidate")

